#4101
In the Lakeshore Tavern~
   You are standing in the common room of the Lakeshore Tavern. The rough-hewn
walls of stone hold many portraits of heroes and legends from the past. Maybe
one day, you could have your portrait here, too. The tables and chairs
surrounding you look comfortable and inviting, but not as inviting as the
roaring fireplace to the east.
   To the southeast, a bar where one can order drinks or food seats thirsty
patrons.
~
