#4102
In the Lakeshore Tavern~
   You are standing before a roaring fireplace in the Lakeshore Tavern. The
warmth of the fireplace is very comforting, as is the general atmosphere of the
tavern. It's no mystery as to why so many people like to come here.
   Just south of here, the back door of the tavern leads out to the docks.
