#4103
On the Docks at the Lakeshore Tavern~
   You are standing on the old wooden docks just behind the Lakeshore Tavern.
Looking out east over the beautiful Lake Kialoren, you can only wonder at the
majesty that is nature. The fast-flowing Bhyroga River flows into the lake
just north of you. To the south, you can see the back door of the Lakeshore
Tavern.
~
