In the Lakeshore Tavern~
   You are standing just before the back door of the Lakeshore Tavern. The
common room is full of life, as people sit around at tables with mugs of ale,
recounting numerous tales of bravery and heroism. Just south of here, you can
see the bar, where fine food and drink is served.
   To the north, a cozy fireplace is embedded in the wall.
