In the Lakeshore Tavern~
   The common room bustles with life, and looks very much as if it never dies.
The wooden spiral stairs leading up to the second floor here seem like they've
been here for centuries, but they're just as firm as when they were first put
in. A welcoming bar to the east offers refreshment.
