#4107
In the Lakeshore Tavern~
   You are standing beside the bar inside the common room of the Lakeshore
Tavern. The worn and polished bar looks grand, despite its age. The aged
innkeeper stands behind the bar, directing his workers with a kind, but firm
tone of voice. Waitresses walk in and out of the door to the east that leads to
the kitchen.
