#4109
Inside the Lakeshore Tavern~
   You stand just inside the doorway of the Lakeshore Tavern, gathering place
of legendary heroes and adventurers. The common room where you stand has a 
warm friendly look. The rough stone walls hold portraits of the many infamous
travellers who have patronized this place. Tables and chairs surround you to
the north and east, some filled with chattering people.
   South of here, some stairs lead to what must be the guestrooms, while the
bar lies to the southeast.
~
